OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FErling Haaland has called on
OL,7,FManchester City fans to "stick
OL,8,Ftogether and stay positive", ahead of
OL,9,Ftheir first game since being found
OL,10,Fguilty of more than 100 breaches of
OL,11,FPremier League financial rules.
OL,13,FEnzo Maresca's side will take on
OL,14,Ffierce rivals Liverpool FC at Anfield
OL,15,Fon Sunday, 11 October.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
