OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791485298
OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FCity have insisted they are innocent
OL,7,Fand have launched an appeal, but
OL,8,Fspeculation is rife across the
OL,9,Ffootball world as to what sanctions
OL,10,Fthe club may face, after an
OL,11,Findependent commission said they broke
OL,12,Fthe rules between 2009-10 and 2017-18.
OL,14,FNorway international and star striker
OL,15,FHaaland joined City from Borussia
OL,16,FDortmund for #51.2 million in June
OL,17,F2022.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
