OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791485298
OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FIn an interview, he said: "So we have
OL,7,Fto stay positive, look ahead and then
OL,8,Ftry to win football games and then try
OL,9,Fto enjoy the situation and the game.
OL,11,F"We have to stick together and we have
OL,12,Fto spread the love to each other. So,
OL,13,Fstick together and enjoy the ride and
OL,14,Fsmile."
OL,16,FThe independent commission concluded
OL,17,Fmore than #830million of owner funding
OL,18,Fwas used to inflate revenues and
OL,19,Fenable City to comply with Premier
OL,20,FLeague and UEFA regulations through a
OL,21,Fseries of "sham" arrangements.
