PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791485298
OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FCity said the commission's judgment
OL,7,Fcontained "clear material errors, of
OL,8,Flaw, principle and fact, and is
OL,9,Funsafe" and that there was "a
OL,10,Fcomprehensive body of irrefutable
OL,11,Fevidence" to support their position.
OL,13,FHaaland, whose father Alf-Inge also
OL,14,Fplayed for City, added: "I care a lot
OL,15,Fabout the city, I have to say.
OL,17,F"I care a lot about the fans because
OL,18,FI'm a fan myself and I feel with them
OL,19,Fas well."
