OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FCity boss Maresca was all smiles as he
OL,7,Farrived for training on Thursday, 8
OL,8,FOctober, pictured grinning and giving
OL,9,Fa thumbs-up as the squad reunited
OL,10,Fafter the extended international break.
OL,12,FThe manager, who will address the
OL,13,Fmedia for the first time since the
OL,14,Fverdict on Friday, 9 October, will
OL,15,Fhope his players can put the furore to
OL,16,Fone side and pick up where they left
OL,17,Foff in the Premier League, having won
OL,18,Fall of their opening five matches to
OL,19,Ftop the table.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
