OL,3,CHaaland tells Man City fans to 'stick
OL,4,Ctogether, enjoy the ride and smile'
OL,6,FHis predecessor as City boss, Pep
OL,7,FGuardiola, who has publicly stressed
OL,8,Fhis support for the club, is
OL,9,Funderstood to be attending the
OL,10,FChampions League game at home to Paris
OL,11,FSt Germain next week.
